    "updated_at": "2019-04-26T14:39:51Z",
    "body": "Could you explain why the straightforward solution of calling `close()` on the existing notification programmatically isn't sufficient?\r\n\r\nI guess one case is if the Service Worker runtime gets shutdown between when the notification shows and when you would like to dismiss the notification… though that wasn't mention so far…",
